# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Proprietary engineering drawings — NEVER commit these.
#
# Inputs/ holds customer manufacturing drawings (PDF + DWG). samples/ is the
# documented drop point for real drawings to audit locally (see samples/README).
# Both are confidential per CONSTITUTION §Security: uploaded documents stay on
# this machine. Only the checked-in README and the synthetic fixture generator
# are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Inputs/
samples/*
!samples/README.md

# Generated test drawings — rebuilt by `python -m tests.fixtures samples/generated`
samples/generated/

